<view class="container">
  <view class="kicker">反直觉系列 · 04</view>
  <view class="title">汉诺塔 · 最少步</view>
  <view class="subtitle">三根柱子，大盘不能压小盘。把整座塔从 A 搬到 C，最少要 2ⁿ−1 步。提示会直接告诉你下一步。</view>

  <view class="levels">
    <view class="level {{n === 3 ? 'active' : ''}}" data-n="3" bindtap="level">3 层</view>
    <view class="level {{n === 4 ? 'active' : ''}}" data-n="4" bindtap="level">4 层</view>
    <view class="level {{n === 5 ? 'active' : ''}}" data-n="5" bindtap="level">5 层</view>
    <view class="level {{n === 6 ? 'active' : ''}}" data-n="6" bindtap="level">6 层</view>
  </view>

  <view class="status">
    <text class="status-main">步数 {{moves}} / 最少 {{minMoves}}</text>
    <text class="status-tip">{{win ? '完成！' : (selected === -1 ? '点一根柱子拿起圆盘' : '再点一根柱子放下')}}</text>
  </view>

  <view class="board">
    <view wx:for="{{pegs}}" wx:key="label" wx:for-item="p" wx:for-index="pi" class="peg {{selected === pi ? 'active' : ''}}" data-index="{{pi}}" bindtap="tapPeg">
      <view class="rod"></view>
      <view class="disks">
        <view wx:for="{{p.disks}}" wx:key="size" wx:for-item="d" class="disk" style="width: {{d.width}}rpx; background: {{d.size % 2 === 0 ? '#7c6cf0' : '#b49cff'}};">{{d.size}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="peg-label">{{p.label}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="actions">
    <view class="btn-primary" bindtap="showHint">提示下一步</view>
    <view class="btn-ghost" bindtap="reset">重来</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{hint}}" class="hint">{{hint}}</view>

  <view class="rule">
    <view class="rule-title">数学解释</view>
    <view class="rule-text">T(n) = 2 × T(n−1) + 1，T(1) = 1，解得 T(n) = 2ⁿ − 1。每多一层，步数几乎翻倍；这不是手速问题，是指数增长。</view>
  </view>
</view>
